信多奇偉，學者好之。稱公羊高親受子夏，立于漢朝，辭義清雋，斷決明審，董仲舒之所善也。穀梁赤師徒相傳，暫立於漢世。向、歆，漢之碩儒，猶父子各執一家，莫肯相從。其書文清義約，諸所發明，或是《左氏》、《公羊》所不載，亦足有所訂正。是以三傳並行於先代，通才未能孤廢。今去聖久遠，其文將墮，與其過廢，寧與過立。臣以為三傳雖同曰《春秋》，而發端異趣，案如三家異同之說，此乃義則戰爭之場，辭亦劍戟之鋒，於理不可得共。博士宜各置一人，以博其學。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-075-xunsong-families:xunsong-body-138:p001:m0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"fp6_ia6_7yw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-075-xunsong-families:xunsong-body-138:p001:m0087","start":87,"end":90,"surface":"左丘明","kind":"person","person_id":"99j_eyj_m1z","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-075-xunsong-families:xunsong-body-138:p001:m0091","start":91,"end":93,"surface":"子夏","kind":"person","person_id":"z8l_wje_08d","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-075-xunsong-families:xunsong-body-138:p001:m0103","start":103,"end":105,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"fp6_ia6_7yw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-075-xunsong-families:xunsong-body-138:p001:m0115","start":115,"end":117,"surface":"丘明","kind":"person","person_id":"99j_eyj_m1z","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-075-xunsong-families:xunsong-body-138:p001:m0160","start":160,"end":163,"surface":"公羊高","kind":"person","person_id":"8k9_qop_y1z","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-075-xunsong-families:xunsong-body-138:p001:m0165","start":165,"end":167,"surface":"子夏","kind":"person","person_id":"z8l_wje_08d","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-075-xunsong-families:xunsong-body-138:p001:m0183","start":183,"end":186,"surface":"董仲舒","kind":"person","person_id":"6m0_g4r_x9t","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-075-xunsong-families:xunsong-body-138:p001:m0191","start":191,"end":194,"surface":"穀梁赤","kind":"person","person_id":"xw8_v2g_5az","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-075-xunsong-families:xunsong-body-138:p001:m0205","start":205,"end":206,"surface":"向","kind":"person","person_id":"3c2_3za_ei5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-075-xunsong-families:xunsong-body-138:p001:m0207","start":207,"end":208,"surface":"歆","kind":"person","person_id":"j16_o3y_zot","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-075-xunsong-families:xunsong-body-138:p001:m0299","start":299,"end":300,"surface":"臣","kind":"person","person_id":"yoo_ox0_545_BABAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"source_position":{"first_line":138,"last_line":138,"revision_id":2645530,"editorial_excerpt_boundary":true},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-075-xunsong-families","book_id":"b-jinshu-075","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-075-xunsong-families"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:p030","text":"班固稱曰：公孫弘、卜式、兒寬皆以鴻漸之翼困於燕雀，遠跡羊豕之閒，非遇其時，焉能致此位乎？是時漢興六十餘載，海內乂安，府庫充實，而四夷未賓，制度多闕，上方欲用文武，求之如弗及。始以蒲輪迎枚生，見主父而嘆息。群臣慕向，異人并出。卜式試於芻牧，弘羊擢於賈豎，衛青奮於奴仆，日磾出於降虜，斯亦曩時版筑飯牛之朋矣。漢之得人，於茲為盛。儒雅則公孫弘、董仲舒、兒寬，篤行則石建、石慶，質直則汲黯、卜式，推賢則韓安國、鄭當時，定令則趙禹、張湯，文章則司馬遷、相如，滑稽則東方朔、枚皋，應對則嚴助、朱買臣，歷數則唐都、落下閎，協律則李延年，運籌則桑弘羊，奉使則張騫、蘇武，將帥則衛青、霍去病，受遺則霍光、金日磾。其餘不可勝紀。是以興造功業，制度遺文，後世莫及。孝宣承統，纂修洪業，亦講論六藝，招選茂異，而蕭望之、梁丘賀、夏侯勝、韋玄成、嚴彭祖、尹更始以儒術進，劉向、王褒以文章顯。將相則張安世、趙充國、魏相、邴吉、于定國、杜延年，治民則黃霸、王成、龔遂、鄭弘、邵信臣、韓延壽、尹翁歸、趙廣漢之屬，皆有功跡見述於後。累其名臣，亦其次也。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"witness_appended_bangu_note","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m030-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"班固","kind":"person","person_id":"gxd_15x_9d0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m030-0005","start":5,"end":8,"surface":"公孫弘","kind":"person","person_id":"q69_35n_f3h","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m030-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"卜式","kind":"person","person_id":"h6s_hqj_u6k","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m030-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"兒寬","kind":"person","person_id":"x8r_9sk_d7a","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m030-0074","start":74,"end":75,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p